| Name             | Type                                                          | Description                                           |
|------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
| id               | int                                                           | Investor ID                                           |
| external_id      | string                                                        | Your investor identifier                              |
| advisor          | int                                                           | Advisor ID                                            |
| household        | int                                                           | Household ID                                          |
| is_prospect      | bool                                                          | Indicates if the investor is a client or a prospect   |
| phone            | string                                                        | Phone of the investor                                 |
| user             | [User Object](#user-object-definition)                        | User info                                             |
| date_of_birth    | date                                                          | Date of birth (`YYYY-MM-DD`)                          |
| marital_status   | string                                                        | One of `single`, `married`, `divorced`, `widowed`, `domestic_partner` |
| dependants       | int                                                           | Number of dependants                                  |
| employment_status | string                                                       | One of `employed`, `self_employed`, `retired`, `unemployed`, `student`, `homemaker` |
| occupation       | string                                                        | Occupation                                            |
| mailing_address  | string                                                        | Street address                                        |
| city             | string                                                        | City                                                  |
| state            | string                                                        | State or region                                       |
| zip              | string                                                        | Postal code                                           |
| country_of_citizenship | string                                                  | ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code                       |
| country_of_residence | string                                                    | ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code                       |
| investment_objective | string                                                    | Name of one of your firm's standardized investment objectives; `""` when unset. Exclusive with `investment_objective_custom` |
| investment_objective_custom | string                                             | Free-text investment objective for firms without standardized objectives. Exclusive with `investment_objective` |
| investment_experience | int                                                      | Years of investing experience                         |
| investment_experience_level | string                                             | One of `none`, `limited`, `moderate`, `extensive`     |
| time_horizon     | int                                                           | Investment time horizon in exact years. Exclusive with `time_horizon_bucket` |
| time_horizon_bucket | string                                                     | One of `under_5`, `5_to_10`, `10_to_20`, `over_20`. Exclusive with `time_horizon` |
| liquidity_needs  | decimal                                                       | Dollar amount the investor needs to keep liquid       |
| annual_income    | decimal                                                       | Annual income                                         |
| annual_expenses  | decimal                                                       | Annual expenses                                       |
| special_expenses | decimal                                                       | Planned special expenses                              |
| net_worth        | decimal                                                       | Total net worth                                       |
| liquid_net_worth | decimal                                                       | Liquid net worth                                      |
| investable_assets | decimal                                                      | Investable assets                                     |
| advisory_fee     | decimal                                                       | Advisory fee, percent (for example `1.250`)           |
| tax_rate         | decimal                                                       | Income tax rate, percent                              |
| tax_bracket      | string                                                        | One of `low`, `medium`, `high`, `top`                 |
| exceptions_enabled | bool                                                        | Surveillance exceptions are raised for this investor (default `true`) |
| clients_review_enabled | bool                                                    | The investor is included in client reviews (default `true`) |
| checkins_enabled | bool                                                          | Check-ins are sent to the investor (default `true`)   |
| created_at       | datetime                                                      | Read only. When the investor was created              |
| updated_at       | datetime                                                      | Read only. Last change to the investor                |
| next_review_date | date                                                          | Read only. Earliest next review date across the investor's accounts |
| data_points      | object                                                        | Read only. Answers collected by questionnaires        |
| integration_link_updated_at | datetime                                           | Read only. Last time an integration updated the investor |
| risk.scores      | [Scores Factors](#scores-factors)                             | Investor aggregated risk scores                       |
| risk.media       | [Scores Media](#scores-media)                                 | Investor aggregated risk scores images                |
| tolerance.scores | [Scores Factors](#scores-factors)                             | Investor aggregated tolerance scores                  |
| tolerance.media  | [Scores Media](#scores-factors)                               | Investor aggregated tolerance scores images           |
| drift            | float                                                         | Investor drift score                                  |
| sources          | List of [Sources Objects](#investor-source-object-definition) | List of sources that are associated with the investor |                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |

