## Create Investor

> Create Investor

```shell
curl -X POST "https://backend.stratifi.com/api/v1/investors/" -H "Authorization: Bearer {{ access-token }}" \
  -d '{
    "external_id": "inv-1",
    "advisor": 1,
    "household": 1,
    "phone": "754-3010",
    "user": {
      "first_name": "Brian",
      "last_name": "May",
      "email": "brian.may@example.com"
    },
    "date_of_birth": "1947-07-19",
    "employment_status": "self_employed",
    "investment_objective": "Growth",
    "time_horizon_bucket": "over_20",
    "net_worth": 1250000,
    "tax_bracket": "high"
  }'

{
  "id": 150,
  "external_id": "inv-1",
  "advisor": 1,
  "household": 1,
  "phone": "754-3010",
  "user": {
    "first_name": "Brian",
    "last_name": "May",
    "email": "brian.may@example.com"
  },
  "risk": {…},
  "tolerance": {…},
  "drift": 5.1,
  "sources": […]
}
```

-request-type: POST

-request-url: `/investors/`

**Request Parameters**

| Parameter   | Type                                   |          |
|-------------|----------------------------------------|----------|
| user        | [User Object](#user-object-definition) | Required |
| advisor     | int                                    | Required |
| household   | int                                    | Optional |
| phone       | string                                 | Optional |
| external_id | string                                 | Optional |
| is_prospect | bool                                   | Optional |
| date_of_birth, marital_status, dependants, employment_status, occupation, mailing_address, city, state, zip, country_of_citizenship, country_of_residence | see [Investor Object](#investor-object-definition) | Optional |
| investment_objective, investment_objective_custom, investment_experience, investment_experience_level, time_horizon, time_horizon_bucket, liquidity_needs | see [Investor Object](#investor-object-definition) | Optional. Sending both halves of an exclusive pair returns a `400` |
| annual_income, annual_expenses, special_expenses, net_worth, liquid_net_worth, investable_assets, advisory_fee, tax_rate, tax_bracket | see [Investor Object](#investor-object-definition) | Optional |
| exceptions_enabled, clients_review_enabled, checkins_enabled | bool | Optional |

**Response:** The new [investor object](#investor-object-definition).

